# Inventura: project context (technical only)

These are PROJECT-SPECIFIC technical constraints.
Do NOT override global communication/teaching rules.

- This is an offline-first web app (PWA).
- The app must continue working without internet.
- Local data is stored in IndexedDB (browser database).
- Remote backend (Supabase) is used only for synchronization.
- Network can fail at any time; all network actions must handle errors gracefully.